  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧. Compound verb: ⟦{追|お}う→追う：02016_ou⟧ + ⟦{払|はら}う→払う：00535_harau⟧.\n\nNUANCE: The ⟦{払|はら}う→払う：00535_harau⟧ component adds the sense of sweeping away or brushing off. Can be used both for physical beings (animals, people) and abstract concepts (worries, bad thoughts).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{虫|むし}→虫：02262_mushi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}い{払|はら}う: to shoo away bugs\n- ⟦{邪気|じゃき}→邪気：29599_jaki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}い{払|はら}う: to drive away evil spirits\n- ⟦{不安|ふあん}→不安：00836_fuan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{追|お}い{払|はら}う: to chase away anxiety\n\nSIMILAR:\n- ⟦{追|お}い{出|だ}す→追い出す：04625_oidasu⟧: to throw out, to kick out (more forceful)\n- ⟦{振|ふ}り{払|はら}う→振り払う：06239_furiharau⟧: to shake off",
